name xstest-prompts
# The readme: "xstest_prompts.csv contains all test prompts"; "unsafe prompts ... are those where the "type" starts
# with "contrast_"". The columns' names are the file's own: id, prompt, type, label, focus, note.
# A prompt is the text it is; the two kinds of file number the prompts differently (1, v2-1).
match xstest_prompts.csv
grammar table
separator ,
header
quoted

claims
together
subject in prompt
attest *
